    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοστρᾰκ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>banishment by ostracism,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖσθαι κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Them.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Themist.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῆς γῆς</span>
			<i>formation of any external shell,</i> interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				17
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοστεϊσμόν</span>).</div>
